{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-mcp","type":"group","x":-1280,"y":210,"width":1720,"height":880,"color":"#e17055","label":"⚙️ 3. LiveKit MCP Server (livekit-mcp :8000) [THE MIDDLE-MAN]"},
		{"id":"group-backend","type":"group","x":560,"y":-740,"width":1200,"height":900,"color":"#0984e3","label":"📱 2. MantraAssist Backend (MantraAssist-backend :5500) [MCP CLIENT]"},
		{"id":"group-lkt","type":"group","x":-290,"y":1520,"width":800,"height":540,"color":"#00b894","label":"🤖 4. LiveKit Voice Agent (lkt :8081) [TELEPHONY ENGINE]"},
		{"id":"group-caller","type":"group","x":780,"y":820,"width":620,"height":540,"color":"#fdcb6e","label":"📞 5. Telephony Phone Call (Inbound / Outbound)"},
		{"id":"group-auth","type":"group","x":-600,"y":-840,"width":640,"height":480,"color":"#6c5ce7","label":"🔐 1. Mantra Auth Server (mantra-auth :3000)"},
		{"id":"node-caller-user","type":"text","text":"👤 **Patient / Customer on Phone**\n• Calling from US: `+1 202 555 0123`\n• Expects clinic times in their local timezone (EDT)\n• Inbound or Outbound Care Call","fontSize":12,"x":810,"y":880,"width":260,"height":200,"color":"#ffeaa7"},
		{"id":"node-caller-dialogue","type":"text","text":"💬 **Live Spoken Conversation**\n\n🗣️ **Caller:**\n*\"Is Dr. Sharma available next Tuesday afternoon?\"*\n\n🤖 **Voice Agent:**\n*\"Dr. Sharma has open slots on Tuesday at 10:00 AM EDT and 12:00 PM EDT. Which time works best for you?\"*","fontSize":12,"x":1090,"y":880,"width":280,"height":440,"color":"#ffeaa7"},
		{"id":"node-caller-flow","type":"text","text":"⚡ **Real-Time Turnaround Time (<150ms)**\n1. Caller speaks question\n2. Deepgram STT transcribes speech\n3. LLM invokes `check_doctor_availability`\n4. MCP Server returns localized slots\n5. Cartesia TTS speaks answer","fontSize":12,"x":810,"y":1110,"width":260,"height":210,"color":"#ffeaa7"},
		{"id":"node-lkt-agent","type":"text","text":"🤖 **LiveKit Voice Agent Worker (mantra/agent.py)**\n• STT: Deepgram Nova-3 (Bilingual English/Hindi)\n• LLM: GPT-4o-Mini / DeepSeek V4\n• TTS: Cartesia Sonic-3\n• VAD: Silero VAD + Turn Detection","fontSize":12,"x":-270,"y":1580,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"#55efc4"},
		{"id":"node-lkt-telephony","type":"text","text":"🔌 **SIP Telephony Trunks & LiveKit Cloud**\n• Twilio / Plivo Zentrunk / Zadarma / VoiceLink\n• Connects live telephone audio stream to WebRTC Room\n• Full bi-directional voice streaming in <400ms latency","fontSize":12,"x":-90,"y":1810,"width":460,"height":210,"color":"#55efc4"},
		{"id":"node-lkt-tool","type":"text","text":"🧩 **Function Tool: check_doctor_availability**\n• Defined inside `AssistantFunctions`\n• Registered in `agent_tools`\n• Triggered dynamically when caller asks scheduling questions\n• Invokes `POST http://localhost:8000/api/tools/call` with JWT","fontSize":12,"x":120,"y":1580,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"#55efc4"},
		{"id":"node-mcp-timezone","type":"text","text":"🌍 **International Timezone Engine**\n• Google `phonenumbers` + `zoneinfo`\n• `+1 202...` (US) ➔ `America/New_York` (EDT)\n• `+44 20...` (UK) ➔ `Europe/London` (BST)\n• `+91 83...` (India) ➔ `Asia/Kolkata` (IST)\n• `+971 50...` (UAE) ➔ `Asia/Dubai` (GST)","fontSize":12,"x":0,"y":770,"width":380,"height":270,"color":"#fab1a0"},
		{"id":"node-mcp-tools","type":"text","text":"🛠️ **Tool: receive_doctor_availability**\n• Accepts array of providers with UTC slots\n• Auto-detects caller country from `caller_phone`\n• Normalizes UTC ➔ Caller's Local Time (EDT, GMT, IST, GST)\n• Formats voice-friendly context for LLM","fontSize":12,"x":-1240,"y":770,"width":410,"height":270,"color":"#ff7675"},
		{"id":"node-mcp-core","type":"text","text":"⚙️ **LiveKit MCP Server (:8000)**\n• Python 3.11 + Starlette ASGI + Uvicorn\n• MCP 2.0 Protocol Compliance\n• Endpoints: `/sse`, `/messages`, `/health`, `/api/tools/call`","fontSize":12,"x":-1210,"y":270,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"#fab1a0"},
		{"id":"node-mcp-auth","type":"text","text":"🛡️ **Pure ASGI Auth Middleware**\n• Validates shared HS256 `JWT_SECRET`\n• Supports `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header\n• Supports `?token=<token>` query param for EventSource","fontSize":12,"x":-205,"y":490,"width":410,"height":160,"color":"#fab1a0"},
		{"id":"node-auth-core","type":"text","text":"🔐 **Mantra Auth (:3000)**\n• Next.js 15 OAuth 2.1 Server\n• PostgreSQL: `mantra_auth_dev` (:5441)\n• Admin: `admin@mantracare.com`\n• Manages OAuth Clients & Issues HS256 JWTs","fontSize":12,"x":-580,"y":-780,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"#a29bfe"},
		{"id":"node-auth-token","type":"text","text":"🔑 **POST /api/oauth/token**\n`grant_type: \"client_credentials\"`\n➔ Returns HS256 JWT Access Token\n➔ Contains `sub`, `aud`, `exp`, `scope: \"mcp:all\"`","fontSize":12,"x":-440,"y":-570,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"#a29bfe"},
		{"id":"node-auth-client","type":"text","text":"🪪 **OAuth Client Config**\n• `Client ID`: `test-client-id`\n• `Client Secret`: `mantra_backend_secret_2026`\n• `Trusted`: `true` (Allows AI / backend to obtain tokens without browser consent)","fontSize":12,"x":-280,"y":-780,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"#a29bfe"},
		{"id":"node-backend-core","type":"text","text":"📱 **MantraAssist Backend Service**\n• Express.js / TypeScript Core Backend\n• Installs `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`\n• Acts as **MCP Client** (No custom REST polling needed!)","fontSize":12,"x":582,"y":-670,"width":340,"height":190,"color":"#74b9ff"},
		{"id":"node-backend-db","type":"text","text":"🗄️ **Prisma Database Client**\n• Queries PostgreSQL (`assist_db`)\n• Reads doctor working hours (`user_availability`)\n• Subtracts booked appointments (`appointments`)\n• Keeps open slots in **UTC** (e.g. `14:00 - 15:00`)","fontSize":12,"x":1160,"y":-400,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"#74b9ff"},
		{"id":"node-backend-payload","type":"text","text":"📦 **Clean Payload Contract (structure.json)**\n```json\n{\n  \"org_id\": 66,\n  \"date\": \"2026-08-25\",\n  \"caller_phone\": \"+12025550123\",\n  \"providers\": [{\n    \"user_id\": 12,\n    \"name\": \"Dr. Ananya Sharma\",\n    \"available_slots\": [\"14:00 - 15:00\", \"16:00 - 17:00\"]\n  }]\n}\n```","fontSize":11,"x":720,"y":-220,"width":520,"height":330,"color":"#74b9ff"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"node-auth-token","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-backend-core","toSide":"left","color":"#6c5ce7","label":"1. Issues JWT Access Token"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"node-backend-core","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-backend-db","toSide":"left","color":"#0984e3","label":"2. Queries Working Hours"},
